YouTube Global Dashboard
📺 YouTube Global Statistics Dashboard
Overview

This project analyzes global YouTube channel statistics and trends through an interactive Power BI dashboard. The dashboard helps understand channel performance, subscriber growth, video engagement, and category-wise trends.

Objectives
Analyze top-performing YouTube channels.
Compare subscribers, views, and uploads.
Discover content category trends.
Evaluate audience engagement metrics.
Key Metrics
Total Subscribers
Total Video Views
Total Uploads
Average Views per Channel
Channel Category Performance
Dashboard Features
Top channels ranking
Country-wise channel distribution
Category performance analysis
Subscriber and views comparison
Interactive filtering and drill-through
Tools Used
Power BI
Excel/CSV
DAX
Data Modeling
Business Insights
Identified countries producing the highest-performing channels.
Compared subscriber growth across categories.
Highlighted channels with exceptional engagement rates.
Revealed content trends driving audience growth.
